  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth - RLC - Mobile Chilimba Cash Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobile Chilimba is a disruptive mobile platform that combines technology with the local culture of traditional savings groups with its core goal being to boost financial inclusion in Zambia. The platform is USSD supported and therefore functions on any mobile phone. The platform enables savings group members to manage their contributions more efficiently and transparently by providing them with a safe digital wallet.</narrative>
  </description>
